The LOINC version is 2.83, as published in the Tuva Project's public LOINC
terminology table (data asset tuva-core 1.0.0); see data/loinc/MANIFEST.yaml.

Some LOINC codes identify instruments owned by third parties (for example
survey and assessment instruments). LOINC records such a code's owner in its
EXTERNAL_COPYRIGHT_NOTICE field. Where an entry in kb/ binds such a code, the
notice is reproduced verbatim on that entry, and
tests/test_loinc_measurement_schema.py enforces it. dismech binds the code and
cites published thresholds; it does not reproduce any instrument's items.
